<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8812" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cō^clĕa</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cō^chlĕa</span></b> ; cf. the letter C),
			ae, f.
		
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοχλίας, ό</span>
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
			snail</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quom caletur cocleae in occulto latent,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 1, 1, 12</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 56, 82, § 173 sq.</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Div.
				2, 64, 133</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Auct. Her. 4, 49,
			62</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. S. 2, 4, 59</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nudae,</span>”
				<i>without shells</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					29, 6, 36, § 112</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">an emblem of slowness,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 3, 1, 29</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> In
			cocleam, <i>snail-formed</i>, <i>spiral</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 8, 10, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 17,
				2</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per cocleam ascendebat in cenaculum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 3
					Reg. 6, 8</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A snail-shell</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 11,
				18, 23</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A screw of a press</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 6,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>A machine for drawing water</i>, <i>a
				water-snail</i>, <i>waterscrew</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 5,
			12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 8</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">10,
			11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>D.</b>
			<i>A door that moves easily</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 3, 5, 3</span></i> Schneid.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
